      <p source="#source-562-756"><seg source="#source-562-622">此さし出候帯屋も助たしかなる人なれバ、皆</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-622-655">〻</g><seg source="#source-655-694">様御返じ何なりとも御なし可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-694-706">レ</note><seg source="#source-706-709">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-709-721">レ</note><seg source="#source-721-756">下候。私がおり候所ハ、</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-756-845" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-777-843"><seg source="#source-777-792">下の関東本</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-795-843"><seg source="#source-792-795">陳</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-816-828">（ママ）</seg></note></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-845-883" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p source="#source-866-883"><seg source="#source-866-883">伊藤助太夫</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-883-936"><seg source="#source-883-936">右の所ニて候（早々）御返じ御こし。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-936-956"><seg source="#source-936-956">私しの名ハ、</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-956-985" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-977-985"><seg source="#source-977-985">薩州</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-985-1029" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p source="#source-1006-1029"><seg source="#source-1006-1029">才谷梅太郎と御</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-1029-1053"><seg source="#source-1029-1053">あてニて御こし。</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
